         * @param string $cron_schedule A cron-link schedule string.
         * @see http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cron
         *   *    *    *    *    *    *
         *   ┬    ┬    ┬    ┬    ┬    ┬
         *   |    |    |    |    |    |
         *   |    |    |    |    |    + year [optional]
         *   |    |    |    |    +----- day of week (0 - 7) (Sunday=0 or 7)
         *   |    |    |    +---------- month (1 - 12)
         *   |    |    +--------------- day of month (1 - 31)
         *   |    +-------------------- hour (0 - 23)
         *   +------------------------- min (0 - 59)
